# forge/fit/rivets: rivets (WROUGHT, FURNACE, River, Imperial; 28.3): a rivet head on the seams the cut marks (N: band
# joins, splint gaps, the plate's lower edge) every fourth pixel: one lit pixel (+2) on the dark seam: the delight, each
# rivet catching the top-left light.
# FORGE-MARKS, forge i2 (tools: emb_P2c/forge/areas/FORGE-MARKS/tools2/mk2.py). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
# FITTING (`overlay fit.<v>`): P-box fits (`tags tile overlay fit`, `on-region P`: the largest <w>x<h> view that fits
# the piece's panel, centred: bosses, star rivets, knotwork), seam fittings (`on-region N`, a periodic tile on the seams
# the cut marks: rivets), or plane tiles (`on-slot:<slot>`, as a cut: studs, scored lines, the inlay band, lacing).
# Cells as the limb tile's (region tiles) or the cut tile's (plane tiles).
# (FORGE-MARKS forge i3) rivets: a bright head (+2) every 4th pixel along the seams (N), each catching the top-left light.
use person
role overlay fit.rivets
tags tile overlay
on-region N
legend + ink 3
legend ^ ink 4
legend : ink 1
legend = ink 0
legend O metal2 2

























view D key rest origin 0 0
|^...
|.^..
|..^.
|...^
